@startuml SSD_us080

title US080 - Create Flight Plan - System Sequence Diagram

actor Pilot

participant "AISafe System" as System

activate Pilot

Pilot -> System : asks to create a flight plan
activate System

System --> Pilot : shows active routes for pilot's company

Pilot -> System : selects route
System --> Pilot : shows route details and available aircraft

Pilot -> System : provides aircraft,\ndeparture date/time,\nfuel quantity,\nflight plan description

System --> Pilot : shows flight plan summary\nand asks for confirmation

Pilot -> System : confirms creation

System -> System : validates route, aircraft,\npilot and fuel quantity

alt valid data
    System --> Pilot : informs flight plan was created as DRAFT
else invalid data
    System --> Pilot : informs error and reason
end

deactivate System

@enduml